# CDK asset staging directory
.cdk.staging
cdk.out
# `/docs/*` (not `/docs/`) so subdirectory negations below take effect.
# Git can't re-include files whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# parent must stay un-excluded; we exclude its CONTENTS instead.
/docs/*
# Pilot-greenlight plan + per-pilot dossiers are tracked — the rest of
# /docs/ stays local-only for working notes. Specific files force-added
# in the past (docs/AWS_CLI_OPERATIONS_GUIDE.md, docs/decisions/*) remain
# tracked under their own pre-existing add.
!/docs/pilot-greenlight/
!/docs/pilots/
# `docs/deploys/INDEX.md` is the curated deploy audit trail per CLAUDE.md;
# tracked here. Raw .log files in docs/deploys/ remain ignored — they're
# operator-runtime artifacts (build output, ECS responses) that don't add
# durable signal beyond what INDEX.md captures.
!/docs/deploys/
/docs/deploys/*
!/docs/deploys/INDEX.md
# V1 platform-hardening sprint plan (drives Sprints A-D post-first-pilot).
!/docs/platform-hardening/
# Governance-body archetype framework plan (cross-repo north-star + backend plan).
!/docs/archetype-framework/
# Program-management roadmap & delivery-governance plan (cross-initiative SSOT).
!/docs/program-management/
*service-info.json
cdk.context.json
